      "note": {
        "zh": "※ 木卫一与木卫二、木卫三处于轨道共振（拉普拉斯共振），每绕木星4圈，木卫二绕2圈，木卫三绕1圈，这种共振导致潮汐加热驱动其火山活动。",
        "en": "※ Io is in orbital resonance with Europa and Ganymede (Laplace resonance): for every 4 orbits of Io, Europa orbits twice and Ganymede once, causing tidal heating that drives its volcanism."
      }
    },
