        {
          "label": {
            "zh": "大气成分",
            "en": "Atmospheric Composition"
          },
          "value": {
            "zh": "二氧化硫（SO₂）为主，另有硫、氧、钠、钾等",
            "en": "Primarily sulfur dioxide (SO₂), with sulfur, oxygen, sodium, potassium"
          }
        },
        {
          "label": {
            "zh": "磁场强度",
            "en": "Magnetic Field Strength"
          },
          "value": {
            "zh": "无固有磁场，但受木星磁场强烈影响，产生感应磁场",
            "en": "No intrinsic magnetic field, but strongly influenced by Jupiter's magnetosphere, inducing a magnetic field"
          }
        }
      ],
      "note": {
        "zh": "※ 木卫一的火山喷发可将硫和二氧化硫喷射到500公里高的太空中，形成巨大的等离子体环（木卫一等离子体环）。",
        "en": "※ Io's volcanic eruptions can eject sulfur and sulfur dioxide up to 500 km into space, forming a massive plasma torus (Io plasma torus)."
      }
    },
